{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q7277837","formula":"C₂₄H₂₅ClN₂O","hill":"C24H25ClN2O","elements":["H","C","N","O","Cl"],"composition":{"C":24.0,"H":25.0,"N":2.0,"O":1.0,"Cl":1.0},"names":{"en":"RTI-371"},"descriptions":{"en":"3β-(4-Methylphenyl)-2β-[3-(4-chlorophenyl)isoxazol-5-yl]tropane (RTI-4229-371) is a phenyltropane derived drug which acts as a potent and selective dopamine reuptake inhibitor in vitro, yet unusually for this class of compound, both RTI-371 and the closely related compound RTI-370 failed to produce locomotor stimulation in mice. In addition to this, in drug substitution tests RTI-370 weakly generalized to cocaine whereas RTI-371 did not generalize at all. This phenomenon has also been observed for other dopamine reuptake inhibitors from other classes."},"fame":4,"pubchemCid":11474847,"mass":392.9,"charge":0,"smiles":"CC1=CC=C(C=C1)[C@H]2C[C@@H]3CC[C@H]([C@H]2C4=CC(=NO4)C5=CC=C(C=C5)Cl)N3C","inchikey":"MUVQRHMVRFZUGP-IKJKNFHUSA-N","iupac":"3-(4-chlorophenyl)-5-[(1R,2S,3S,5S)-8-methyl-3-(4-methylphenyl)-8-azabicyclo[3.2.1]octan-2-yl]-1,2-oxazole","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"11474847","atoms":53,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":7.633,"y":-0.577,"z":0.234,"el":"Cl"},{"x":-0.271,"y":-1.112,"z":-0.911,"el":"O"},{"x":-2.929,"y":-2.392,"z":-0.542,"el":"N"},{"x":1.086,"y":-1.145,"z":-1.209,"el":"N"},{"x":-2.56,"y":-2.096,"z":0.854,"el":"C"},{"x":-4.092,"y":-1.52,"z":-0.769,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.854,"y":-0.706,"z":0.898,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.724,"y":0.421,"z":0.246,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.536,"y":-0.093,"z":-0.973,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.911,"y":-2.051,"z":1.586,"el":"C"},{"x":-4.922,"y":-1.647,"z":0.511,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.409,"y":-0.788,"z":0.388,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.996,"y":1.747,"z":0.072,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.221,"y":-3.804,"z":-0.769,"el":"C"},{"x":0.79,"y":-